 =?UTF-8?q?s=20second=20home=20(uhome=20step=201250)=20lasted=200.5=20s,?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20the=20tick=20never=20sampled=20HOMING,=20'READY=20for=205=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?s=20without=20HOMING'=20failed=20and=20poisoned=20the=20route,?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20TI=20reported=20the=20alarm=20and=20ckernel=20GetMotorAlarmC?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ode=20raised=20WAR240141=20(Out=20Of=20Torque=20/=20Power=20Off?=
 =?UTF-8?q?)=20on=20a=20READY,=20servo-on,=20alarm-free=20drive.=20Card-si?=
